WEBVTT

00:04:59.329 --> 00:05:00.538
a parent with your children,

00:05:01.663 --> 00:05:04.246
which was just kind of a stunning
spillover for me to, you know,

00:05:04.246 --> 00:05:07.246
to think that the way you get
treated at work might affect

00:05:07.246 --> 00:05:10.121
the way that you raise your children who
just never would have occurred to me.

00:05:11.038 --> 00:05:13.579
And I think that body of research and

00:05:13.579 --> 00:05:18.163
a whole bunch of other studies that
followed kind of that they made me start

00:05:18.163 --> 00:05:19.871
to think about this basic truth,

00:05:19.871 --> 00:05:23.121
that when we lack control in
one domain of our lives,

00:05:23.454 --> 00:05:27.954
we become motivated to seek it and try to
regain it in other parts of our lives.

00:05:28.913 --> 00:05:32.829
And I think, you know, especially
in the wake of this pandemic and